abstract: >-
  Data contract, QLoRA training pipeline, pre-registered evaluation harness and
  serving stack behind the KLEOS Hermes v0.0.6 and KLEOS Logos v0.0.2 adapters,
  trained on Mistral AI open-weight models and evaluated on a 349-example
  held-out decision benchmark.
